OL,3,AJury in Lindsay Clancy trial resumes
OL,4,Adeliberations as defence blames one
OL,5,Ajuror for deadlock
OL,6,
OL,7,FLawyers and the judge in the trial of
OL,8,FLindsay Clancy, the US mother accused
OL,9,Fof murdering her three children, have
OL,10,Fsparred over jury instructions as court
OL,11,Fresumes in Massachusetts - you can
OL,12,Fwatch live above
OL,14,FJurors have been instructed to resume
OL,15,Fdeliberations for the seventh day after
OL,16,Fa tense day in court on Thursday, where
OL,17,FClancy's defence lawyer asked the judge
OL,18,Fto dismiss a juror - a request the
OL,19,Fjudge denied
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
